        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SSP4215, 42 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 42 Inch Contemporary Pull can be used in commercial as well as residential applications. It is made out of durable stainless steel and is available in brushed stainless, polished stainless, or black finishes. This door pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware for wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. It is modern and sexy--the perfect finishing touch for any home or office door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-MSQP42-size.gif?v=1704354647\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-MSQP42-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-contemporary-pull-deltana-ssp2410\"><b>24\" Stainless Steel Square Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/18-inch-contemporary-pull-deltana-ssp1810\"><b>18\" Stainless Steel Square Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Square Stainless Steel Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 25\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 2-1/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for glass, fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP2410-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262342\"><b>Deltana SSP2410 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
