                "description": "The 42 Inch Contemporary Pull can be used in commercial as well as residential applications. It is made out of durable stainless steel and is available in brushed stainless, polished stainless, or black finishes. This 42 Inch door pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware for wood, metal, or glass doors. It is modern and sexy--the perfect finishing touch for any home or office door.",
